  "description": "中文: 为 SQLitePCLRaw e_sqlite3 提供 NativeAOT 静态链接支持。引用此 NuGet 包后，在 PublishAot=true 发布时会根据 RuntimeIdentifier 自动选择并链接对应平台的 SQLite 静态库，减少对外部 e_sqlite3 动态库的依赖。 English: Static e_sqlite3 native libraries for SQLitePCLRaw NativeAOT publishing. Add the package and the buildTransitive targets select the matching static SQLite library for the current RuntimeIdentifier during AOT publish.",
